[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0371","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0449","title":"Omnis Omnis Studio 2.4 数据库字段弱加密漏洞","description":"Omnis Studio 2.4 数据库工具在数据库字段加密时使用了弱加密算法，仅实现了简单的转码而非真正的加密保护，攻击者可以轻易绕过加密机制获取原始数据。该漏洞影响所有使用 Omnis Studio 2.4 的用户，可能泄露数据库中的敏感信息，包括用户凭据、商业机密、个人隐私等。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用此漏洞，完全破坏了数据库加密的安全性，攻击难度低但破坏力极强，导致系统完全保密、完整性和可用性遭到严重破坏。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0449"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45.473","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Omnis Studio 3.0 或更高版本（官方已修复弱加密问题）。如无法立即升级，建议在应用层对敏感数据库字段实施 AES-256 加密存储，或启用数据库透明加密（TDE）保护敏感字段，同时在应用层实施字段级加密作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0311.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1255","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19967","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0449.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0449","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0449.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0449.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jr8c-jq2f-gfh3/GHSA-jr8c-jq2f-gfh3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0449.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3940e07c0108f0ccff15cf6d7011c1c64b16d80e/2000.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0449.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0359","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0359.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0440","title":"NetBSD IP Timestamp 选项拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本存在 IP 时间戳选项拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞原理为远程攻击者向目标系统发送包含未对齐 IP 时间戳选项的恶意数据包时，由于内核在处理带有非标准对齐方式的 IP 时间戳选项时缺乏充分验证，导致内核panic或服务崩溃，从而引发拒绝服务。影响范围包括 FreeBSD 3.4/4.0/5.0 以及 NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本系统。攻击条件为：攻击者具备网络可达性，且无需认证凭据即可完成攻击。攻击者仅需构造并发送一个包含未对齐 IP 时间戳选项的数据包即可触发漏洞，利用方式简单，可直接导致目标主机不可用或服务中断，对系统可用性造成严重影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0440"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.310","remediation":"NetBSD 用户应立即升级至 NetBSD 1.4.2 或更高版本，FreeBSD 用户应升级至 FreeBSD 4.1-STABLE、5.0-CURRENT 修复版本或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL，过滤携带 IP Timestamp 选项（option type 0x44）的数据包，以临时缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1173","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19896","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84a32f54509ea69818fd2f28519fed9f2968cec3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0440.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0440","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0440.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efe50030f98e26c62a2548f14fe89d9f72e2021/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0440.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3fw7-2f85-c369/GHSA-3fw7-2f85-c369.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--55ba3501-8aef-42cc-a283-cb7ca217a369.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0440.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--55ba3501-8aef-42cc-a283-cb7ca217a369.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0347","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0347.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0344","title":"Linux Kernel knfsd NFS 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux Kernel 2.2.x 版本中的 knfsd NFS 服务器存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含负值大小参数的恶意 NFS 请求触发该漏洞，导致 knfsd 服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.1/2.2.0/2.3.0 等版本，攻击无需身份认证且无需用户交互，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0344"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.287","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2.2.x 后续版本中已修复），或在 NFS 服务器上限制 knfsd 的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网段连接，同时禁用 NFSv2 协议以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1160","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0005012042550.6419-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0344","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0344.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p8m9-pjr4-qwm7/GHSA-p8m9-pjr4-qwm7.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/knfs_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0347.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0291","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0341","title":"Atrium Software Cassandra NNTP Server 1.10 登录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Cassandra NNTP Server 1.10 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向登录认证接口提交超长用户名，触发服务端缓冲区溢出，导致 NNTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击条件简单，仅需发送特制超长字符串即可触发。公开的 ExploitDB 编号 19884 提供了完整的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0341"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.910","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 Atrium Software Cassandra NNTP Server 1.10 中，该产品已停止维护且厂商不再提供补丁。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 NNTP 服务器软件（如 INN、Leafnode 等）。在完成迁移前，可在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 119 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=95736106504870&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1156","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19884","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0341.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0341","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0341.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0341.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-82rf-86fv-87vg/GHSA-82rf-86fv-87vg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0341.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4d289393-9ec2-4a22-8ec0-b70ee028cd88.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0290","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0340","title":"SuSE Linux Gnomelib 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"S.u.S.E. Linux 6.3/6.4 版本中的 Gnomelib 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于对 DISPLAY 环境变量缺乏边界长度检查。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 DISPLAY 环境变量值触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上以提升后的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.3 和 6.4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、完全机密性/完整性/可用性影响），攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可利用。攻击者可构造恶意环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，劫持程序控制流执行任意 Shellcode 实现本地提权。ExploitDB 已收录该漏洞的本地缓冲区溢出利用代码（EDB-ID: 19883）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0340"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.770","remediation":"升级至 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.4 或更高版本，该版本中的 gnomelib 已修复 DISPLAY 环境变量缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可移除 /opt/gnome/sbin/gnome-pty-helper 的 setgid 权限（chmod g-s /opt/gnome/sbin/gnome-pty-helper），并限制本地用户对 DISPLAY 变量的异常长度输入作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1155","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=00042902575201.09597%40wintermute-pub","http://www.suse.com/us/support/download/updates/axp_63.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19883","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0340.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0340","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0340.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0340.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7r2-2mff-xm27/GHSA-r7r2-2mff-xm27.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0340.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001326.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--97ad9843-21b0-4426-9018-a22266ea74ed.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0293","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0342","title":"Qualcomm Eudora 4.x 可执行附件警告绕过漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Eudora 4.x 邮件客户端存在安全警告绕过漏洞（CWE-59，链接跟随问题）。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含 .lnk 快捷方式文件的恶意邮件，该快捷方式指向 .exe、.com 或 .bat 等可执行附件，从而绕过 Eudora 内置的可执行附件安全警告机制。当用户点击看似无害的 .lnk 文件时，系统将自动执行其指向的可执行程序，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需任何身份认证，仅需诱使用户打开邮件即可触发。该漏洞影响 Eudora 4.x 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0342"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-28T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.033","remediation":"升级到 Eudora 5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 .lnk 文件绕过附件警告的问题。如无法升级，请在 Eudora 设置中禁用\"自动打开附件\"选项，并教育用户不要打开来自不可信来源的 .lnk 后缀文件。同时可在邮件网关层面过滤带有 .lnk 附件的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://news.cnet.com/news/0-1005-200-1773077.html?tag=st.ne.fd.lthd.1005-200-1773077","http://www.peacefire.org/security/stealthattach/explanation.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1157","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/23399","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0342.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0342.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0342","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0342.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0342.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-885f-x463-v454/GHSA-885f-x463-v454.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-356.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/jmohitz/SECAI/blob/33119e592f944e313664a5f75ae76284ea4b3fe8/data/CWE/356.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0293.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0293.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0293.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0352","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0429","title":"McMurtrey/Whitaker & Associates Cart32 后门密码远程代码执行漏洞","description":"McMurtrey/Whitaker & Associates Cart32 2.6/3.0 版本中存在后门密码漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用默认后门密码登录管理后台，进而执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Cart32 3.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。攻击者无需任何认证即可远程利用该后门密码获取系统控制权。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC 利用代码（EDB-19881）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0429"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42.837","remediation":"建议立即迁移至现代电商平台（如 Shopify、Magento、WooCommerce 等），Cart32 早已停止维护且官方无补丁。若必须继续使用，请立即：1) 在防火墙层面仅允许受信 IP 访问 /admin 管理后台；2) 修改所有默认/弱口令，强制使用 16 位以上强密码；3) 在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含默认后门密码的登录请求；4) 禁用不必要的远程管理功能，仅允许 VPN 内网访问管理后台。建议尽快完成迁移，彻底消除该 20 年前的后门风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95686068203138&w=2","http://www.cart32.com/kbshow.asp?article=c048","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19881","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0429.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0429","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0429.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0429.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qr5c-3r3w-6h26/GHSA-qr5c-3r3w-6h26.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/c32.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0429.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0352.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0352.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0315","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0380","title":"Cisco IOS HTTP 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.1 至 12.1 版本的 HTTP 服务存在输入验证漏洞（CWE-20）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标路由器的 HTTP 服务发送包含连续百分号（%%）的特制 URL 请求，触发服务崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Cisco 全系列路由器和交换机，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。攻击者只需知道目标设备 IP 地址即可发起攻击，利用难度低。Cisco 官方已发布安全公告，建议升级至 IOS 12.1 以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0380"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35.753","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.1(1) 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTTP 服务对 `%%` 字符串的输入验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在全局配置模式下使用 `no ip http server` 命令关闭 HTTP 服务，或通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问 HTTP 管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0261.html","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/ioshttpserver-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1302","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1154","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19882","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0380.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0380","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0380.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0380.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g22v-2gp9-xpmh/GHSA-g22v-2gp9-xpmh.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/routersploit/routersploit/modules/exploits/routers/cisco/CVE-2000-0380-pl.py","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0315.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0315.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0225","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0249","title":"IBM AIX Fast Response Cache Accelerator 本地任意文件修改漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 操作系统的 Fast Response Cache Accelerator (FRCA) 组件中的 frcactrl 程序存在配置安全缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该程序的配置功能修改系统任意文件，导致权限提升或系统完整性遭破坏。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0249"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-26","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"安装 IBM APAR IY06437 提供的 AIX 安全补丁，或升级至 AIX 5.2 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：执行 chmod 0500 /usr/sbin/frcactrl 移除 setuid root 权限，若未使用 FRCA 功能可删除该二进制文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1152","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise47.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0249.json","https://github.com/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xwq6-j9m4-9grh/GHSA-xwq6-j9m4-9grh.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0225.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0327","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0326","title":"NetManage Meeting Maker 弱加密漏洞","description":"Meeting Maker 使用弱加密算法（多表代换密码）存储用户密码，远程攻击者可通过网络嗅探捕获加密后的密码数据，并利用该弱加密算法的可逆性进行解密，从而获取明文密码。该漏洞影响 Meeting Maker 所有版本，攻击者无需认证即可实施攻击，可能导致敏感账户信息泄露。建议升级至修复版本或采用强加密算法保护密码传输与存储。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0326"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28.997","remediation":"建议升级 Meeting Maker 至 6.0 及以上版本（1998 年后版本引入了更强加密机制），或迁移至支持现代加密协议（如 TLS 1.2+ 及 AES-256）的日程管理方案。如无法升级，应在网络入口配置防火墙规则限制对 Meeting Maker 服务端口（默认 624/625 UDP）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 段连接，并通过 VPN 加密所有传输流量。避免在不可信网络中通过明文中继连接服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.on.com/support/mmxp.nsf/31af51e08bcc93eb852565a90056138b/11af70407a16b165852568c50056a952?OpenDocument","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1151","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0326.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0326","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0326.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0326.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p25g-qrm9-c6cx/GHSA-p25g-qrm9-c6cx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1151/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001321.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d94d184c-6c47-465c-8557-68285fbe2e06.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0269","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0324","title":"Symantec pcAnywhere TCP SYN扫描拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Symantec pcAnywhere 8.x 及 9.0 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送大量 TCP SYN 扫描数据包（如使用 nmap 工具），导致 pcAnywhere 服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击门槛低，影响 pcAnywhere 8.0.1、8.0.2、9.0 及 9.2 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0324"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28.727","remediation":"升级到 Symantec pcAnywhere 10.0 及以上版本。若无法升级，可在边界防火墙上限制对 pcAnywhere 服务端口（默认 TCP 5631）的源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员地址访问；同时在服务器上启用 TCP SYN Cookie 保护（Linux: sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=1；Windows Server: 设置注册表 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters\\SynAttackProtect=1）以缓解 SYN 类拒绝服务攻击。Symantec pcAnywhere 已于 2016 年停止支持，建议迁移至受支持的远程桌面解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0201.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0258.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4347.php","http://www.osvdb.org/1301","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1150","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000425150157.13567A-100000%40sword.damocles.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19880","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0324.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0324","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0324.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0324.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f77g-jx4w-4qjp/GHSA-f77g-jx4w-4qjp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0324.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b8bd3849-a75d-46e5-9eea-b8ce247120cf.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0709","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0248","title":"Red Hat Linux Piranha 虚拟服务器包 Web GUI 默认后门账户漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 的 Piranha 虚拟服务器软件包中，Web GUI 管理界面存在硬编码后门账户与密码漏洞。远程攻击者可通过使用预设的默认凭据登录管理后台，无需身份认证即可直接执行任意系统命令，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及早期版本中安装 Piranha 软件包的系统，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 10.0。建议用户立即升级软件包或修改默认凭据。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0248"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19.057","remediation":"立即删除 /etc/sysconfig/ha/lvs.cf 中默认的 \"piranha\" 账户及密码条目，或升级到 Red Hat 6.2 之后的安全更新版本。如无法升级，在 iptables 中限制对 9090 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许管理地址连接 Web GUI。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise46.php3","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19879","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0248.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0248","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0248.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0248.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9rr2-45q8-fjmg/GHSA-9rr2-45q8-fjmg.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d22f3c9e25f72f18a485d952583551d073f9cf47/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/piranha.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0709.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0709.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0336","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0336.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0334","title":"Allaire Spectra 容器编辑器预览对象安全绕过漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 容器编辑器预览工具存在对象安全策略未正确执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向容器对象添加带有发布规则的对象方法（object-method）来绕过权限检查，从而执行未授权的操作。该漏洞影响 Allaire Spectra 系列产品，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致部分机密信息泄露。官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0334"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.020","remediation":"立即安装 Allaire 官方发布的 Spectra 安全补丁（参考 Allaire 安全公告 ID=15411）。由于 Allaire Spectra 产品已停止维护且厂商已被收购，建议迁移至其他受支持的容器内容管理平台，并在迁移前严格限制对容器编辑器的访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理员使用预览工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/i