VE-2000-0339","title":"Zone Labs ZoneAlarm 个人防火墙防火墙绕过漏洞","description":"Zone Labs ZoneAlarm 2.1.10 及更早版本的个人防火墙存在安全规则绕过漏洞。该软件未对源端口为 67（DHCP/BOOTP 服务端口）的 UDP 数据包进行过滤，导致远程攻击者可通过发送特制的源端口为 67 的 UDP 数据包绕过防火墙规则，实现未授权访问。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响防火墙的访问控制有效性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0339"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.653","remediation":"立即升级 ZoneAlarm 至 2.1.20 或更高版本，该版本已修复 UDP 源端口 67 绕过防火墙规则的问题。如无法升级，可在防火墙规则中手动添加一条阻止所有来自外部网络、源端口为 67 的 UDP 入站流量的规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1294","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1137","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000421044123.2353.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19871","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0339.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0339","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0339.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0339.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g3hr-wqqr-vrqq/GHSA-g3hr-wqqr-vrqq.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/zone_alarm_fw_p67.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0339.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https